  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax Administration Modernization 2 Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Objectives  The development objective of the Project is to carry out a systematic reform and modernization of the tax administration of the Russian Federation (RF)comma so as to: (a) facilitate voluntary compliancecomma (b) increase administrative efficiencycomma (c) strengthen enforcement capacitycomma (d) enhance professional integrity and skillscomma and (e) improve tax legislation and fairness in the implementation of tax laws. The project supports the strategic goals of promoting macro-economic stabilitycomma improving the environment for private sector developmentcomma strengthening public institutionscomma and combating corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
